    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >My Story</h2>I'm Mr. Moo! Over the last 5+ years, I've been obsessed with trying to make an amazing platformer, with tons of fun mechanics and super tight controls. Despite having a fulltime job, I've poured a large majority of my free time into perfecting the smallest of details. After lots of trial and error, Stolen Hearts: Wolf Knight is the combination of my best work, rolled up into a funny story about a birthday party gone wrong. <br><br>Stolen Hearts has been a great passion of mine for a while and it's inspired by so many of my favorite games, within and outside the genre. If you do decide to give my game a try, thank you so much for your support and I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I've enjoyed making it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/f27e6ab2c6dd802641d2523e128e84a2.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/f27e6ab2c6dd802641d2523e128e84a2.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/f27e6ab2c6dd802641d2523e128e84a2.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Hearts' village has been attacked by The Wolf King and his army of minions! The Hearts have been kidnapped and scattered all over the forest and it's your job to bring them home, in this super-tight platformer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Stolen Hearts: Wolf Knight can be enjoyed by players of a wide range of skill, but will reward those who enjoy 100%-ing games, whether that be through exploring every nook and cranny to find hidden secrets or replaying levels to beat their best times. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Meticulously designed levels that test your skill, strength, and craftiness<br></li><li> Collectable fireflies that can be used as currency in the item shop<br></li><li> Three-star and unlockable diamond rank time trials<br></li><li> Cosmetics to personalize your character<br></li><li> Hidden features that can only be unlocked through mystery challenges </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Hearts and Bring them Home</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/898290f402a307b3d05194a9ea290745.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/898290f402a307b3d05194a9ea290745.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/898290f402a307b3d05194a9ea290745.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Enemies and Take their Powers</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/b16a42c5e8f0b9ab420808fb5d82d015.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/b16a42c5e8f0b9ab420808fb5d82d015.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/b16a42c5e8f0b9ab420808fb5d82d015.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Hidden Fireflies to Buy Cosmetics</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/e2dd5a484668c49648961f1f129f67f1.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/e2dd5a484668c49648961f1f129f67f1.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/e2dd5a484668c49648961f1f129f67f1.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Controls</h2>The controls are simple, but you'll need to learn them well if you want to get in and out of tricky spots. <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>Dash</strong>, <strong>Fly</strong>, <strong>Climb</strong>,<strong> Carry</strong>, <strong>Throw</strong>, and <strong>Bounce </strong> your way through enemies, puzzles, mazes, and a variety of difficult challenges. Many fun and interesting mechanics are waiting to be discovered within the Wolf's Wood. <br><br><i>Be Strong. Be Smart. Be A Hero</i>",
