ngth, and craftiness<br></li><li> Collectable fireflies that can be used as currency in the item shop<br></li><li> Three-star and unlockable diamond rank time trials<br></li><li> Cosmetics to personalize your character<br></li><li> Hidden features that can only be unlocked through mystery challenges </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Hearts and Bring them Home</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/898290f402a307b3d05194a9ea290745.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/898290f402a307b3d05194a9ea290745.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/898290f402a307b3d05194a9ea290745.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Enemies and Take their Powers</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/b16a42c5e8f0b9ab420808fb5d82d015.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/b16a42c5e8f0b9ab420808fb5d82d015.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/b16a42c5e8f0b9ab420808fb5d82d015.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Hidden Fireflies to Buy Cosmetics</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/e2dd5a484668c49648961f1f129f67f1.poster.avif?t=1721058975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/e2dd5a484668c49648961f1f129f67f1.webm?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462320/extras/e2dd5a484668c49648961f1f129f67f1.mp4?t=1721058975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Controls</h2>The controls are simple, but you'll need to learn them well if you want to get in and out of tricky spots. <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>Dash</strong>, <strong>Fly</strong>, <strong>Climb</strong>,<strong> Carry</strong>, <strong>Throw</strong>, and <strong>Bounce </strong> your way through enemies, puzzles, mazes, and a variety of difficult challenges. Many fun and interesting mechanics are waiting to be discovered within the Wolf's Wood. <br><br><i>Be Strong. Be Smart. Be A Hero</i>",
